  "explicit_limitations": [
    "Hardware lock-in in v1 evaluation: all measurements ran solely on AMD Instinct MI355X (ROCm 7, Pollara NICs) with pinned container images; NVIDIA GPU validation is explicitly future work (§7).",
    "Strict anchor-coverage bounds: anchored accuracy applies only within matching engine build/kernels, ≤4x anchor concurrency, and at most one TP doubling (GLM-5.2 prefill scaling slows from 1.80x TP2->4 to 1.32x TP4->8).",
    "Unmeasured modeled features: EAGLE-3, DSpark, and n-gram speculative drafters (§5.9) plus all six named kernel fusions (§4, Table 21) are predicted/modeled only without MI355X empirical validation in v1; simulate mode supports intra-engine ranking only.",
    "High TTFT variance and high-error outliers: TTFT errors (13.6% fixed, 16.9% disaggregated, 1.23x agentic) substantially exceed TPOT errors; AgentX DeepSeek-V4-Pro SGLang FP4 reaches 2.01x ITL factor (Table 17), TP8xPP2 reaches 33.8% throughput error (Table 8), and shortlist GPU confirmation remains mandatory.",
    "Artifact release & audit boundary: Appendix I schema was uploaded separately and anchors/corpora/scripts are slated for camera-ready release (Appendix K); this close reading audited the v1 PDF/text without locally running MI355X benchmarks."
